\section{Introduction}
\label{introduction}
Covid-19 has become a global health concern, resulting in a significant number of fatalities worldwide. Early detection of Covid-19 is vital to minimize its life-threatening consequences. A novel deep learning technique, called Dense-Res2Net, is proposed for efficient Covid-19 detection. It combines the advantages of ResNet and Multi-head self-attention-based Transformer to achieve impressive results. A comprehensive analysis of the model's robustness to noisy labels and effectiveness in low-resource settings is conducted. The code and model are made available for public access on GitHub. The findings of this study can be applied to develop more efficient Covid-~19 detection methods. 
